<div class="section-width--thin">
  <h2>[ Hero Image Wave - Section ]</h2>
  <br />
  <p>
    A hero that's always a centered column, with an accent flourish and an
    <code>image-wave</code> component beneath the content. Takes:
  </p>
  <br />
  <ul class="classic-list">
    <li><code>eyebrow</code> an optional string shown above the title.</li>
    <li><code>title</code> and <code>description</code> strings.</li>
    <li>
      <code>accent</code> an optional string, decorative text positioned
      absolutely beside the copy. Hidden on mobile (<code>lg</code> and down).
      Leave unset to omit.
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>cta_1</code> / <code>cta_2</code> same shape as the
      <code>cta-group</code> component.
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>images</code> an array of images ( <code>src</code> /
      <code>alt</code> ) passed to the <code>image-wave</code> component.
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>wave</code> an optional object of <code>image-wave</code> configs —
      <code>repeat</code>, <code>speed</code>, <code>duration</code>,
      <code>amplitude</code>, <code>waves</code>, <code>scrub</code>,
      <code>class</code>. See the component's docs for what each does.
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
